readmes.en:
Implement `RemoveIndexSignature<T>` , exclude the index signature from object types.

For example:

```ts
type Foo = {
  [key: string]: any
  foo(): void
}

type A = RemoveIndexSignature<Foo> // expected { foo(): void }
```

